	measure AverageTotalActiveCustomersRow = ```
			
			IF(
			    ISINSCOPE('bnpl_grouped_orders'[enrollment_cohort]) && ISINSCOPE('bnpl_grouped_orders'[monthsSinceEnrollment]),
			    [totalActiveCustomers],
			    AVERAGEX(
			        SUMMARIZE(
			            'bnpl_grouped_orders', 
			            'bnpl_grouped_orders'[enrollment_cohort], 
			            'bnpl_grouped_orders'[monthsSinceEnrollment]
			        ), 
			        [totalActiveCustomers]
			    )
			)
			```
